```

**Follow-ups:** run the full `tiktok-research.anyt` / `instagram-research.anyt` / `youtube-shorts-research.anyt` for two-round keyword expansion + hand-picked deep dives, or `pitch-slides-report.anyt` when it's time to pitch (pricing + deliverables live there).
</note>
